[2026-09-26T19:05:16.461+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]       "specification": "MATERIALIZED SKELETON. Types: AuthUser { id; username; email; emailVerified }; RegisterAccountRequest { username; email; password; confirmPassword; agreeToTerms }; SignInRequest { identifier; password }. Exports: registerAccount(request) -> Promise<AuthUser> (POST /api/auth/register, expect 201), signIn(request) -> Promise<AuthUser> (POST /api/auth/login), signOut() -> Promise<void> (POST /api/auth/logout), fetchSession() -> Promise<AuthUser|null> (GET /api/auth/session). AuthApiError carries status plus fieldErrors so the page can map server messages beside fields. TDD: call apiClient from '../../api', and in the interceptor/error path extract response.data.fieldErrors rather than throwing generic messages; never retry a rejected registration optimistically.",
