[2026-09-26T19:05:16.461+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]       ],
[2026-09-26T19:05:16.461+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]       "outputs": [
[2026-09-26T19:05:16.461+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]         "AuthUser objects, null for unauthenticated session, AuthApiError with fieldErrors"
